l":"https://www.iesdouyin.com/share/video/7580745218401573361","host":"www.iesdouyin.com","source_type":"third_party","content_support_status":"unknown","accessibility":"unknown"},{"sample_id":"CQQ-R2-20261012-OTHER-R01-CQ-Q0115","question_id":"CQ-Q0115","citation_id":"smp-17c0717f5d9e41dab245c2708fe180a0:17","title":"抖店服务市场-服务商主页","raw_url":"https://fuwu.jinritemai.com/providerHomepage?id=7117519253225603341","normalized_url":"https://fuwu.jinritemai.com/providerHomepage?id=7117519253225603341","host":"fuwu.jinritemai.com","source_type":"third_party","content_support_status":"unknown","accessibility":"unknown"},{"sample_id":"CQQ-R2-20261012-OTHER-R01-CQ-Q0115","question_id":"CQ-Q0115","citation_id":"smp-17c0717f5d9e41dab245c2708fe180a0:18","title":"热度云-达人分销全链路解决工具 - 抖音开放平台","raw_url":"https://developer.open-douyin.com/service-market/market-detail/6966916223502275621","normalized_url":"https://developer.open-douyin.com/service-market/market-detail/6966916223502275621","host":"developer.open-douyin.com","source_type":"third_party","content_support_status":"unknown","accessibility":"unknown"},{"sample_id":"CQQ-R2-20261012-OTHER-R01-CQ-Q0115","question_id":"CQ-Q0115","citation_id":"smp-17c0717f5d9e41dab245c2708fe180a0:19","title":null,"raw_url":null,"normalized_url":null,"host":null,"source_type":"unresolved","content_support_status":"unknown","accessibility":"unknown"},{"sample_id":"CQQ-R2-20261012-OTHER-R01-CQ-Q0115","question_id":"CQ-Q0115","citation_id":"smp-17c0717f5d9e41dab245c2708fe180a0:20","title":null,"raw_url":null,"normalized_url":null,"host":null,"source_type":"unresolved","content_support_status":"unknown","accessibility":"unknown"},{"sample_id":"CQQ-R2-20261012-OTHER-R01-CQ-Q0115","question_id":"CQ-Q0115","citation_id":"smp-17c0717f5d9e41dab245c2708fe180a0:21","title":null,"raw_url":null,"normalized_url":null,"host":null,"source_type":"unresolved","content_support_status":"unknown","accessibility":"unknown"},{"sample_id":"CQQ-R2-20261012-OTHER-R01-CQ-Q0115","question_id":"CQ-Q0115","citation_id":"smp-17c0717f5d9e41dab245c2708fe180a0:22","title":null,"raw_url":null,"normalized_url":null,"host":null,"source_type":"unresolved","content_support_status":"unknown","accessibility":"unknown"},{"sample_id":"CQQ-R2-20261012-OTHER-R01-CQ-Q0115","question_id":"CQ-Q0115","citation_id":"smp-17c0717f5d9e41dab245c2708fe180a0:23","title":null,"raw_url":null,"normalized_url":null,"host":null,"source_type":"unresolved","content_support_status":"unknown","accessibility":"unknown"},{"sample_id":"CQQ-R2-20261012-OTHER-R01-CQ-Q0115","question_id":"CQ-Q0115","citation_id":"smp-17c0717f5d9e41dab245c2708fe180a0:24","title":null,"raw_url":null,"normalized_url":null,"host":null,"source_type":"unresolved","content_support_status":"unknown","accessibility":"unknown"}]},{"sample_id":"CQQ-R2-20261013-OTHER-R01-CQ-Q0115","question_id":"CQ-Q0115","question_text":"蝉圈圈和热度云哪个好用？","category":"品牌对比型","pool":"清洗版补充池","sample_date":"2026-10-13","repeat_index":1,"citation_state":"pass","card_count":29,"valid_url_cards":23,"unique_url_events":21,"official_events":5,"strict_question_match":true,"answer_sha256":"bb54803c118eabffb6c548713ca11cc796a86955f5c42a8f0b0cbab69d4efb87","semantic_audit_status":"pending_full_evidence_audit","applicable":["explanation_accuracy","advantage_completeness"],"recommendation_applicable":true,"advantage_items":["A01","A02","A03","A04","A05","A06","A07","A08","A09","A10","A11","A12"],"answer_text":"# 一句话结论\n**做多平台种草（抖音+小红书）、看重达人数据精准度、团队绩效自动核算 → 蝉圈圈更好；只做抖音/快手达人分销、喜欢浏览器插件快速捞达人、多坐席商务团队 → 热度云更合适**\n\n## ✅ 蝉圈圈（蝉妈妈生态）优势\n1. **数据源是自家蝉妈妈**，达人数据、带货数据更完整；支持**商品/品牌反向挖掘竞品达人**，找达人维度更丰富\n2. **原生支持小红书**达人种草全流程管理（热度云小红书能力弱），适合品牌全域种草投放\n3. 自带**开播提醒、爆单实时通知**，样品管理、团队绩效/提成自动计算、数据看板更完善，UI操作更顺滑\n4. 达人建联：可一键抽取达人联系方式，商务BD批量邀约更方便\n\n**短板**：没有浏览器插件，不能在抖音达人广场直接抓取达人，部分版本每日查看达人线索有数量上限；价格整体偏高\n\n## ✅ 热度云（热度星选旗下，原超盘云）优势\n1. **浏览器插件**：抖音达人广场一键抓取达人，快速批量捞达人，起盘达人分销效率高，做抖音团长/分销很顺手\n2. 同价位版本**支持更多商务坐席**，适合BD人员很多的分销团队；素材存储空间更大\n3. 深度适配抖音/快手分销链路，ERP、快递打通成熟，样品物流监控、千川追投联动更强\n\n**短板**：达人数据依赖第三方数据源；**缺少品牌/商品反向搜竞品达人**；小红书种草管理偏弱；没有原生爆单提醒\n\n## 📌 怎么快速选\n- 品牌，**抖音+小红书双平台种草**、要做竞品达人挖掘、看重投放复盘、绩效核算 → **蝉圈圈**\n- 只做**抖音/快手达人分销、团长业务**，商务人多，需要浏览器插件快速扒达人 → **热度云**\n- 小团队预算有限：两个都建议先申请试用，亲自测试自己品类的达人匹配质量\n\n> 两者都是达人分销SaaS，核心模块（达人库、样品管理、合作进度、数据复盘）都齐全，最大差异就是数据源、小红书能力、浏览器插件这三点。\n\n\n\n要不要我给你整理一份试用时的测试清单，你试两个系统直接对照打分？","sources":[{"sample_id":"CQQ-R2-20261013-OTHER-R01-CQ-Q0115","question_id":"CQ-Q0115","citation_id":"smp-c5e80ce7ea7948ed87d83a0b4414b915:1","title":"蝉圈圈& 热度云产品对比分析 - 蝉妈妈运营圈","raw_url":"https://www.chanmama.com/yunyingquan/question/3046.html","normalized_url":"https://www.chanmama.com/yunyingquan/question/3046.html","host":"www.chanmama.com","source_type":"third_party","content_support_status":"unknown","accessibility":"unknown"},{"sample_id":"CQQ-R2-20261013-OTHER-R01-CQ-Q0115","question_id":"CQ-Q0115","citation_id":"smp-c5e80ce7ea7948ed87d83a0b4414b915:2","title":"蝉圈圈 - 一站式多平台达人营销及种草解决方案","raw_url":"https://www.kolkoc.com/bridge","normalized_url":"https://www.kolkoc.com/bridge","host":"www.kolkoc.com","source_type":"official","content_support_status":"unknown","accessibility":"unknown"},{"sample_id":"CQQ-R2-20261013-OTHER-R01-CQ-Q0115","question_id":"CQ-Q0115","citation_id":"smp-c5e80ce7ea7948ed87d83a0b4414b915:3","title":"抖店服务市场-服务详情","raw_url":"https://fuwu.jinritemai.com/detail?service_id=32167","normalized_url":"https://fuwu.jinritemai.com/detail?service_id=32167","host":"fuwu.jinritemai.com","source_type":"third_party","content_support_status":"unknown","accessibility":"unknown"},{"sample_id":"CQQ-R2-20261013-OTHER-R01-CQ-Q0115","question_id":"CQ-Q0115","citation_id":"smp-c5e80ce7ea7948ed87d83a0b4414b915:4","title":"关于我们 - 蝉圈圈","raw_url":"https://www.kolkoc.com/other/about.html","normalized_url":"https://www.kolkoc.com/other/about.html","host":"www.kolkoc.com","source_type":"official","content_support_status":"unknown","accessibility":"unknown"},{"sample_id":"CQQ-R2-20261013-OTHER-R01-CQ-Q0115","question_id":"CQ-Q0115","citation